{"version":1,"content":"<p>唔少情侶本來係舊相識，可能做咗多年同學、同事或同鄉，甚至乎只係點頭之交，但緣分一到，愛火就一發不可收拾。</p><p>AV業界資深人士神仙乙表示，喺日本AV世界入面有唔少喺床上打得火熱嘅男女都係青梅竹馬，久別重遇一刻，即火速撻着，激戰一觸即發。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.331397+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:00:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T19:17:52.420570+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"abe5544428c9ec78891dee4fc4e239925548bd715270ca5318453da640abaef6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}